+// Olympus layer (ext-olympus.js): the look and its switches, Olympus themes, the Day timeline, Focus mode. node planner/tests/olympus.test.js
+// Serve the site first (see shifts.test.js); PORT env, default 8789. Fixed clock: Friday 2026-09-04, 12:30 in New York (lib-todayorg).
